{"baseline":{"amendments":[],"id":"sensor-fan-harness-01-basis","requirements":[{"id":"HARNESS01-TOPOLOGY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"98b9e4a4bcdf8cdec4da31a9ea9182c4377ff515bc6d54404beb2dac72747891"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Geometry and connector views","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"The pin schedule and harness preserve every declared J0/JF/JS pin and net; at B1 only +24V is spliced, while FAN_GND and SIGNAL_RETURN remain separate to the J0 controller star point."},{"id":"HARNESS01-CURRENTS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"current_cont_A,current_start_A","sha256":"98b9e4a4bcdf8cdec4da31a9ea9182c4377ff515bc6d54404beb2dac72747891"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Product and electrical intent","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"Conductor and splice calculations use 0.35/0.70 A fan continuous/start current plus 0.03 A transmitter current, including 0.38/0.73 A on the shared supply trunk."},{"id":"HARNESS01-DROP","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/allowed-wire.csv","locator":"resistance_ohm_per_m_at_20C","sha256":"dc791d7c6604503f1921ccf5bc2a882a1c95c923ae3abb5a249176ce696f8461"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"route_mm,current_cont_A,current_start_A","sha256":"98b9e4a4bcdf8cdec4da31a9ea9182c4377ff515bc6d54404beb2dac72747891"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"Every loaded branch remains at or below 0.72 V drop in separate continuous and startup cases using both supply and return segments at 35 °C, with contact resistance sourced or explicitly assumed."},{"id":"HARNESS01-CUT-LENGTHS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"route_mm","sha256":"98b9e4a4bcdf8cdec4da31a9ea9182c4377ff515bc6d54404beb2dac72747891"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"The cut list derives each unique conductor from installed centerline routes, adds 50 mm service length at each connector termination plus documented strip/crimp allowance, and does not double-count the shared trunk."},{"id":"HARNESS01-CONNECTORS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/connector-requirements.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"1aa74ea61ca1ce85f46022e665c27f2d44e1e89e796b7e0ed09497f3ad9f57ce"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"Selected real connector housings, terminals and tools have sourced compatibility and ratings meeting each pin count, at least the declared current, 30 V and 35 °C; physical pin order is not inferred from logical IDs."},{"id":"HARNESS01-PACKAGING","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Packaging","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"The plan maintains 25 mm minimum bend radius, 30 mm hot-wall clearance, an external bundle, and removable labels at J0, JF and JS."},{"id":"HARNESS01-INTERFACES","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Product and electrical intent","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"The report retains the 22..26 V supply range, 2 A current limit and 3.3 V-compatible PWM/tach assumption while leaving actual fan-interface compatibility for sourced verification."},{"id":"HARNESS01-VIEWS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/context.md","locator":"Outputs","sha256":"f2bea898955a53c3c9bed9f2e483bd1884ea14233ec4b37af560359ea4e27216"}],"text":"Every connector view is explicitly labeled mating-face or wire-entry and is consistent with the exact pin schedule without silent mirroring."},{"id":"HARNESS01-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/01-desktop-incubator/prompt.txt","locator":"requested package","sha256":"c8a828b014091150b33cc55834bdb009bb917637a1e72fd1f994562cec4fd600"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-wo